, "desc": "Bug 2030461 - Use platform path separators with paths from nsIFile.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293871\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297458\n", "files": ["dom/filesystem/FileSystemSecurity.cpp", "dom/filesystem/FileSystemUtils.cpp", "dom/filesystem/FileSystemUtils.h"], "git_node": "182934b61b8d28d8a1a47062767cb3d058d609d0", "git_parents": ["7406771ba09e047179d972cb66160dc4a18b6b04"], "node": "e5e5d572e6b3eb1e96c9ae88b59aa38afd431570", "parents": ["ee678ed780379cf4b461abb9cd8d3ab90f1be952"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777562996, "git_changesets": ["182934b61b8d28d8a1a47062767cb3d058d609d0"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1242": {"changesets": [{"author": "Eden Chuang \u003cechuang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2022576 - Adding IsOtherProcessActor check for BackgroundParentImpl::AllocPRemoteWorkerControllerParent.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289546\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297543\n", "files": ["ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "f92d4ddf11add6fe8d7ff9b32e2265a1d3b0e510", "git_parents": ["182934b61b8d28d8a1a47062767cb3d058d609d0"], "node": "f7128d90fdbd34c32d0ce36ac28f051f91648d41", "parents": ["e5e5d572e6b3eb1e96c9ae88b59aa38afd431570"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777563161, "git_changesets": ["f92d4ddf11add6fe8d7ff9b32e2265a1d3b0e510"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1243": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2034352 - Make URL::SearchParams return an already_AddRefed  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296706\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297578\n", "files": ["dom/url/URL.cpp", "dom/url/URL.h"], "git_node": "8252536c9aa0b1febd3e92f630f6442df2fbf451", "git_parents": ["f92d4ddf11add6fe8d7ff9b32e2265a1d3b0e510"], "node": "cfb87e2485f5fbebea0a65dada9dcc697c062e41", "parents": ["f7128d90fdbd34c32d0ce36ac28f051f91648d41"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777756029, "git_changesets": ["8252536c9aa0b1febd3e92f630f6442df2fbf451"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1244": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2033637.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295654\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297740\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/TextureD3D.cpp"], "git_node": "62879f167fa05eafa1029f7b9868da2153e488fe", "git_parents": ["8252536c9aa0b1febd3e92f630f6442df2fbf451"], "node": "30e726c7f7670dc54835bc7277a7263557fc8cdf", "parents": ["cfb87e2485f5fbebea0a65dada9dcc697c062e41"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777756074, "git_changesets": ["62879f167fa05eafa1029f7b9868da2153e488fe"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1245": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2034422.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296893\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297989\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/State.cpp"], "git_node": "60411f6004bf31f58ae9992946956ba0a97f8b06", "git_parents": ["62879f167fa05eafa1029f7b9868da2153e488fe"], "node": "2c621a07061e82f7cf29566c51d2bd1a6ecde729", "parents": ["30e726c7f7670dc54835bc7277a7263557fc8cdf"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777756119, "git_changesets": ["60411f6004bf31f58ae9992946956ba0a97f8b06"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1246": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2035880.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297553\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297994\n", "files": ["gfx/skia/skia/include/core/SkRegion.h", "gfx/skia/skia/src/core/SkRegion.cpp", "gfx/skia/skia/src/core/SkRegionPriv.h"], "git_node": "c0752fe7900a97ca918e4f691547a03ad01517cc", "git_parents": ["60411f6004bf31f58ae9992946956ba0a97f8b06"], "node": "d805ee5e2e8ea8dc04b2f1e70eca211938c90651", "parents": ["2c621a07061e82f7cf29566c51d2bd1a6ecde729"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777816203, "git_changesets": ["c0752fe7900a97ca918e4f691547a03ad01517cc"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1247": {"changesets": [{"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2035879.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\n[PATCH] D3D11: Fix overflow in compressed 3D texture deferred-init\nFrom 5141d2393c8495286cfa8823c7f664e2b6780286 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\nThe ANGLE D3D11 backend computed the zero-fill buffer size for\nblock-compressed 3D textures using an unchecked\n32-bit multiplication that did not account for block height.\nThis produced a value four times larger than the actual\ncompressed image size and could overflow for sufficiently large\ntextures.\n\nThis fix:\n1. Uses InternalFormat::computeCompressedImageSize to correctly\ncalculate the required buffer size for compressed textures,\ntaking block dimensions into account.\n2. Employs angle::CheckedNumeric for uncompressed texture size\ncalculations to prevent potential integer overflows.\n3. Adds a regression test DeferredInit3DOverflow\nthat uses large texture dimensions (2048x2048x320) to verify\nthere is no ASAN error.\n\nBug: b/497896137\nFixed: b/501314630\nChange-Id: I76f0fb008af34e8ac78870318e608d16ed4ddd93\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/7728091\nReviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi \u003csyoussefi@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Shahbaz Youssefi \u003csyoussefi@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Shrek Shao \u003cshrekshao@google.com\u003e\n(cherry picked from commit 838c9be2bc21df9ab804428d53bf61fa906be4b4)\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/7783400\nReviewed-by: Geoff Lang \u003cgeofflang@chromium.org\u003e\n---\n src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/TextureD3D.cpp      | 20 +++++--\n .../gl_tests/BPTCCompressedTextureTest.cpp    | 52 +++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298021\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/TextureD3D.cpp"], "git_node": "92c040340398daa46356fc98f9b80af3df1c74ec", "git_parents": ["c0752fe7900a97ca918e4f691547a03ad01517cc"], "node": "1593e39402b91983278fb120173e55b48623cd49", "parents": ["d805ee5e2e8ea8dc04b2f1e70eca211938c90651"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777906629, "git_changesets": ["92c040340398daa46356fc98f9b80af3df1c74ec"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1248": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr115 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes -  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298214\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/devtools-compatibility-browsers.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": "5c8bc64da142db3faa9708eae1d91f3c8711d3e5", "git_parents": ["92c040340398daa46356fc98f9b80af3df1c74ec"], "node": "bcb3b678a525c8707b99bbf46f06b8f299abbf4e", "parents": ["1593e39402b91983278fb120173e55b48623cd49"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777906784, "git_changesets": ["5c8bc64da142db3faa9708eae1d91f3c8711d3e5"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1249": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gregory Mierzwinski \u003cgmierz1@live.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2036062 - Don't run perfdocs on non-nightly code-reviews.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nThis patch adds a new transform to prevent perfdocs from being scheduled on try runs from reviewbot that are based on non-nightly branches (e.g. beta/esr/etc.). This task doesn't need to run there for code-reviews and only triggers false positives.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297620\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298385\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/transforms/source_test.py"], "git_node": "9ac54c6b6f790035dd4bbe895b18dcb281e7877b", "git_parents": ["5c8bc64da142db3faa9708eae1d91f3c8711d3e5"], "node": "325b5d9bf0a661173916987d4ac344aa294d584e", "parents": ["bcb3b678a525c8707b99bbf46f06b8f299abbf4e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777940580, "git_changesets": ["9ac54c6b6f790035dd4bbe895b18dcb281e7877b"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1250": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Shin \u003cdshin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2021977:  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293557\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297000\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsTextFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "e590266d2ffcf09342a6635eb3fb8d55d02ad0bb", "git_parents": ["a43128c960773bf31514f4c2ab0e856db1d0a364"], "node": "2022ce8eeb6d10ac9d1874fd3d3b126ae410edb1", "parents": ["5ad865f01f710a758d34917e63cff13d186aabea"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Eden Chuang \u003cechuang@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2022576 - Adding IsOtherProcessActor check for BackgroundParentImpl::AllocPRemoteWorkerControllerParent.  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289546\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297543\n", "files": ["ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "a6c14f5c1a1825b0f5d00c3bf2e087032cde97d7", "git_parents": ["e590266d2ffcf09342a6635eb3fb8d55d02ad0bb"], "node": "1fee4ec72199c4a33f76a4b458a3a1d9b4c9c3e9", "parents": ["2022ce8eeb6d10ac9d1874fd3d3b126ae4