DF surface image emission  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D292028\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297157\n", "files": ["gfx/cairo/cairo/src/cairo-pdf-surface.c"], "git_node": "2ea769317d0ce018418d367e60873799654b8f8d", "git_parents": ["c32c11ee56fd56be4e7bda6afb7af5505f375a7b"], "node": "6b2f5b8aaf03500a9eacd6fa8087b2171be68180", "parents": ["cfc3739ce88d9a0d2910e1273f61eae4131898f2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777953254, "git_changesets": ["e590266d2ffcf09342a6635eb3fb8d55d02ad0bb", "a6c14f5c1a1825b0f5d00c3bf2e087032cde97d7", "ee3cc68eb43cb8163ac1899bd706314142df529f", "4495e4432ee7d55bfd0d1222b95fd82df9535405", "31bcd25d421a455facec437a8c4ca240e5026991", "e586bff9cbbb5498226e16d49d8375c0516d6208", "61c274aa790e64b54df085202be2a7370813a71d", "8162802c698f9253d5fe3491b67976c6e5b51613", "80aef4debea143a3480a86235114d29c7032a027", "2a3d69b8c3510bc46f840bd7fe9c1d137ce2e332", "c32c11ee56fd56be4e7bda6afb7af5505f375a7b", "2ea769317d0ce018418d367e60873799654b8f8d"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1251": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjjalkanen@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2030461 - Use platform path separators with paths from nsIFile.  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293871\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297458\n", "files": ["dom/filesystem/FileSystemSecurity.cpp", "dom/filesystem/FileSystemUtils.cpp", "dom/filesystem/FileSystemUtils.h"], "git_node": "356782b44b3392c8777c079d4ffcb6e56a277820", "git_parents": ["2ea769317d0ce018418d367e60873799654b8f8d"], "node": "7009fa164e12604755180176f621dfa18351eb07", "parents": ["6b2f5b8aaf03500a9eacd6fa8087b2171be68180"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2034352 - Make URL::SearchParams return an already_AddRefed  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296706\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297578\n", "files": ["dom/url/URL.cpp", "dom/url/URL.h"], "git_node": "40914475da9e0628f8856cda619e87e1e3c29aac", "git_parents": ["356782b44b3392c8777c079d4ffcb6e56a277820"], "node": "6ce2d7a7e37f5c20cc8d30f1c1ec02503b039026", "parents": ["7009fa164e12604755180176f621dfa18351eb07"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2034422.  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296893\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297989\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/State.cpp"], "git_node": "c0398b539765bd7ea37f4dfe1e14882bbb6b0237", "git_parents": ["40914475da9e0628f8856cda619e87e1e3c29aac"], "node": "29183734ddc4697a7da849db3d6cb12123af750e", "parents": ["6ce2d7a7e37f5c20cc8d30f1c1ec02503b039026"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2035880.  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297553\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297994\n", "files": ["gfx/skia/skia/include/core/SkRegion.h", "gfx/skia/skia/src/core/SkRegion.cpp", "gfx/skia/skia/src/core/SkRegionPriv.h"], "git_node": "6dd7e81ddc4b932cb3a2b116f2953f02c8e075bc", "git_parents": ["c0398b539765bd7ea37f4dfe1e14882bbb6b0237"], "node": "d73696c2bfc992f700d2c9c47c11af3a479bc3b3", "parents": ["29183734ddc4697a7da849db3d6cb12123af750e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2033637.  a=dsmith\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295654\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297740\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/TextureD3D.cpp"], "git_node": "4de5fd6be2390d17bbe791eadb53b05e18c3f507", "git_parents": ["6dd7e81ddc4b932cb3a2b116f2953f02c8e075bc"], "node": "aa8124bbc1d35569b0ed078bc67cf8d8905669a1", "parents": ["d73696c2bfc992f700d2c9c47c11af3a479bc3b3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2035879.  a=dsmith\n\n[PATCH] D3D11: Fix overflow in compressed 3D texture deferred-init\nFrom 5141d2393c8495286cfa8823c7f664e2b6780286 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\nThe ANGLE D3D11 backend computed the zero-fill buffer size for\nblock-compressed 3D textures using an unchecked\n32-bit multiplication that did not account for block height.\nThis produced a value four times larger than the actual\ncompressed image size and could overflow for sufficiently large\ntextures.\n\nThis fix:\n1. Uses InternalFormat::computeCompressedImageSize to correctly\ncalculate the required buffer size for compressed textures,\ntaking block dimensions into account.\n2. Employs angle::CheckedNumeric for uncompressed texture size\ncalculations to prevent potential integer overflows.\n3. Adds a regression test DeferredInit3DOverflow\nthat uses large texture dimensions (2048x2048x320) to verify\nthere is no ASAN error.\n\nBug: b/497896137\nFixed: b/501314630\nChange-Id: I76f0fb008af34e8ac78870318e608d16ed4ddd93\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/7728091\nReviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi \u003csyoussefi@chromium.org\u003e\nCommit-Queue: Shahbaz Youssefi \u003csyoussefi@chromium.org\u003e\nAuto-Submit: Shrek Shao \u003cshrekshao@google.com\u003e\n(cherry picked from commit 838c9be2bc21df9ab804428d53bf61fa906be4b4)\nReviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/7783400\nReviewed-by: Geoff Lang \u003cgeofflang@chromium.org\u003e\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/TextureD3D.cpp"], "git_node": "e58c152c817fac9119352e4d1398de82a9cf03dc", "git_parents": ["4de5fd6be2390d17bbe791eadb53b05e18c3f507"], "node": "70f3a6e802c0e3504c7033216f16a53b4eaee3d1", "parents": ["aa8124bbc1d35569b0ed078bc67cf8d8905669a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ben Hearsum \u003cben@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2032056: disable esmify mach command r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,jcristau,ahochheiden a=dsmith\n\nThis mach command relies on `pathlib.os`, which doesn't exist in more recent python versions. As far as I can tell, the only references to esmify are within the tool itself, and the wiring of it into mach. I see no evidence that it's used in automation. I doubt anyone is using the tool locally on this branch.\n\n(This error prevents `./mach try` from working.)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294430\n", "files": ["build/mach_initialize.py"], "git_node": "f1c613d758d98159b8809930299c28c16fa3e00d", "git_parents": ["e58c152c817fac9119352e4d1398de82a9cf03dc"], "node": "49eb8f1a48f3022b7718fa56a9dd94b551495cf1", "parents": ["70f3a6e802c0e3504c7033216f16a53b4eaee3d1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777954084, "git_changesets": ["356782b44b3392c8777c079d4ffcb6e56a277820", "40914475da9e0628f8856cda619e87e1e3c29aac", "c0398b539765bd7ea37f4dfe1e14882bbb6b0237", "6dd7e81ddc4b932cb3a2b116f2953f02c8e075bc", "4de5fd6be2390d17bbe791eadb53b05e18c3f507", "e58c152c817fac9119352e4d1398de82a9cf03dc", "f1c613d758d98159b8809930299c28c16fa3e00d"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1252": {"changesets": [{"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@paul.cx\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2036731 - Adjust WPT expectation of k-rate-dynamics-compressor-connections.html on 115. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298234\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/k-rate-dynamics-compressor-connections.html.ini"], "git_node": "9121410a062d6a429491433dbebedde910c5f595", "git_parents": ["9ac54c6b6f790035dd4bbe895b18dcb281e7877b"], "node": "8cfc97ec582269f6af3c404b5d8aca76dc43ee5b", "parents": ["325b5d9bf0a661173916987d4ac344aa294d584e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777986351, "git_changesets": ["9121410a062d6a429491433dbebedde910c5f595"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1253": {"changesets": [{"author": "Teodor Tanasoaia \u003cttanasoaia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2034496.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297022\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298226\n", "files": ["gfx/angle/checkout/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/Buffer11.cpp"], "git_node": "e89a99b9126d22bcf4ac4afc41703cf72b8d6df4", "git_parents": ["9121410a062d6a429491433dbebedde910c5f595"], "node": "2dab0d9e055362f709b2076f38a890a04e1defc2", "parents": ["8cfc97ec582269f6af3c404b5d8aca76dc43ee5b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777986432, "git_changesets": ["e89a99b9126d22bcf4ac4afc41703cf72b8d6df4"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1254": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jim Blandy \u003cjimb@red-bean.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2029910: Cairo: avoid overflow rendering FreeType glyphs.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nIn `_compute_xrender_bitmap_size`, avoid arithmetic overflow in\ncalculating the size needed for the glyph buffer by: rejecting\nunreasonable glyph sizes early, and using 64-bit temporaries to\nmultiply 32-bit values.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298349\n", "files": ["gfx/cairo/cairo/src/cairo-ft-font.c"], "git_node": "b1921a461e3e5aa44b3c8de5398a3bda19ce6a3b", "git_parents": ["e89a99b9126d22bcf4ac4afc41703cf72b8d6df4"], "node": "aa58086edea78bf2221dfb3321321f3da486d7aa", "parents": ["2dab0d9e055362f709b2076f38a890a04e1defc2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777986504, "git_changesets": ["b1921a461e3e5aa44b3c8de5398a3bda19ce6a3b"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1255": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2035915 - DNSpacket cleanup,  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297489\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298252\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/DNSPacket.cpp"], "git_node": "2055e7d2cf0aa555c0d9d73e3489bc6e98379a70", "git_parents": ["b1921a461e3e5aa44b3c8de5398a3bda19ce6a3b"], "node": "a72a33c6384639ef1d6a68069766fbd4da91284c", "parents": ["aa58086edea78bf2221dfb3321321f3da486d7aa"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777986761, "git_changesets": ["2055e7d2cf0aa555c0d9d73e3489bc6e98379a70"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1256": {"changesets": [{"author": "DonalMe \u003c76789979+DonalMe@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2035915 - Fix ESR115 build a=bustage\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/DNSPacket.cpp", "netwerk/dns/DNSPacket.h"], "git_node": "46475802842d2e127aa289e87b3ca67849debc76", "git_parents": ["2055e7d2cf0aa555c0d9d73e3489bc6e98379a70"], "node": "90ebb2f1b52ac58a369bc7ed1047daf852748d1f", "parents": ["a72a33c6384639ef1d6a68069766fbd4da91284c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1777990827, "git_changesets": ["46475802842d2e127aa289e87b3ca67849debc76"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1257": {"changesets": [{"author": "rperta \u003crperta@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "FIREFOX_ESR_115_35_X_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 2031547 - Adjust expectation on two Web Audio API tests after FFT code change on 115, a=dsmith\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-audioparam-interface/k-rate-dynamics-compressor-connections.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/webaudio/the-audio-api/the-oscillatornode-interface/osc-basic-waveform.html.ini"], "git_node": "63c1aad39e2c8a4eec4284a7ec5434d91576b31c", "git_parents": ["f1c613d758d98159b8809930299c28c16fa3e00d"], "node": "a5a220cb8d79cae516954acda2ecdfb33eba7b65", "parents": ["49eb8f1a48f3022b7718fa56a9dd94b551495cf1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@